{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":117347,\"title\":\"Guys with Kids\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Three men—Gao Han, Wang Dongyang, and Yu Bo—are unexpectedly tasked with raising a toddler, Dudu, after the child’s aunt, Guan Shanshan, drops him off. Gao Han, dealing with a custody battle over his daughter, learns that Dudu is the son of his late ex-girlfriend. Amidst the challenges of parenthood and uncovering Dudu’s paternity, the men face complications from Gao Han’s ex-wife and the growing romantic tension between Gao Han and Shanshan, while Yu Bo also develops feelings for her.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zKyl1jgqUm6AvDO02syjemSMKGa.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k6jdL1Zn0UpVaZhF8jORls5pg68.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2021,\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":44,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"Youku\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"CN\",\"name\":\"China\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2021-02-24\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":3166278,\"name\":\"Zhu Dong Ning\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/XVjJll36obJdv1NIrXyncUW5rF.jpg\"},{\"id\":144586,\"name\":\"Bosco Wong Chung-chak\",\"character\":\"Gao Han\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o6RGUQXQRobk2PhoTc6zqpOC9yr.jpg\"},{\"id\":1675906,\"name\":\"Kan Qingzi\",\"character\":\"Guan Shanshan\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q0XuEIcm9eB4tHaKFOvn0ymFo2l.jpg\"},{\"id\":2085450,\"name\":\"Luo Yunxi\",\"character\":\"Yu Bo\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5lgQsiTenZWBXIU7MyQwPNHYkh5.jpg\"},{\"id\":143826,\"name\":\"Huang Xiaolei\",\"character\":\"Ma Xiaohong\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4PrbAr5Hj0ZHubA3o9H0W0Z72GN.jpg\"},{\"id\":1985735,\"name\":\"Mai Hongmei\",\"character\":\"Liu Min\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w3BBnxT